From 9b6a5d37c4fa792828d5c3c6464b50f85c1c8b78 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amit Kumar Mahapatra <amit.kumar-mahapatra@amd.com>
Date: Mon, 18 Aug 2025 23:44:37 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 050/190] mtd: spi-nor: Add SDR-PHY support for OSPI flashes

commit 7838279ac933c84c2a808420586738dabf2014ce from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

Update SPI-NOR to switch to SDR-PHY mode when the flash does not support
the DTR protocol. Modify the driver to configure the controller in SDR-PHY
mode and perform RX tuning, with a fallback to SDR NON-PHY mode if tuning
fails.

Signed-off-by: Amit Kumar Mahapatra <amit.kumar-mahapatra@amd.com>
Message-ID: <20250818181437.1256858-1-amit.kumar-mahapatra@amd.com>
State: pending
Signed-off-by: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
